    "b-ks2-path-runphase-intro": {
      "id": "b-ks2-path-runphase-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "RUN — The run-close phase: fires when a worker run closes. One pathway carries it. The worker summary agent writes the run object — the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "worker_run",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " row and its "
        },
        {
          "insert": "submission",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " rows — advances the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "attempt",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " watermark, and enqueues a "
        },
        {
          "insert": "run_closed",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " index task; the librarian decides, per touched target and entity, whether facts change, citing "
        },
        {
          "insert": "attempt://",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". During the run itself only workers act, and an integration failure never invokes an agent: at run close the run-loop records the outcome deterministically on the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "worker_run",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " row — "
        },
        {
          "insert": "integration",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " "
        },
        {
          "insert": "integrated | conflicted",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "integration_detail",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " with the conflict paths — re-queues the target, and the next worker sees the conflicted run and its paths on its card; no event row, no extra pathway. The summary agent still runs, so the knowledge is not wasted. The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "run_closed",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " context carries, per touched subject, "
        },
        {
          "insert": "renamed_from",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " and the drift report, and the pass is drift-gated — see "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Drift Gate",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "10-system-design/40-knowledge/40-librarian-pathways/50-drift-gate",
              "label": "Drift Gate"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
